            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-xxl",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>As much as we love our pets, dealing with <strong>pet odor<\/strong> is something every pet owner encounters. Whether it’s a wet dog smell, litter box funk, or just everyday dander in the air, pet odor can quickly make your space feel less fresh.<\/p><p>But here’s the good news: you don’t need to rely on chemical-filled sprays or overpowering artificial scents to keep your home smelling clean without masking. Instead, turn to <strong>a more natural way of living with air care solutions<\/strong> that create air that's <strong>optimized for you, and your pet’s, health<\/strong>.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
