            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Pet-Safe Air Care: Top Picks<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Here’s a quick list of pet- and planet-friendly options:<\/p><ol><li><strong>Air Purifier with Carbon Filter  <\/strong>– Best for long-term odor and allergen control.<\/li><li><strong>DIY Spray with Baking Soda + Natural Essential Oils<\/strong>  – A safe and budget-friendly deodorizer.<\/li><li><strong>Activated Charcoal Bags<\/strong>  – Passive odor control <\/li><li><strong>Pet-Safe Essential Oil Diffusers<\/strong> – Use only highly diluted pet-safe essential oils (like lavendar or chamomile), and ensure good ventilation.  Avoid diffusing near cats without veterinarian guidance.<\/li><\/ol><p><\/p><p><strong>Final Thoughts<\/strong><\/p><p>A clean-smelling home doesn’t have to come at the cost of your pet’s health—or the planet’s. By switching to <strong>more natural air care products<\/strong> and using tools like <strong>air purifiers<\/strong>, you can eliminate <strong>pet odor<\/strong> and optimize your home’s air quality for everyone under your roof.<\/p><p>Cleaner air. Happier pets. Healthier home.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        }
      },
