          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you help me choose an air purifier? Which Blueair air purifier is best for me?",
            "title_style": "s1",
            "richtext": "<p>Blueair offers a wide array of air Purifiers that can cater to many needs. When looking for a new purifier, it is important to know and understand what features you may need. We have a convenient quiz on our website that helps choose what purifier is best for you. You can take the quiz here https:\/\/www.blueair.com\/us\/guidedselling\/<\/p><ul><li>Keep pets out of the bedroom of the allergy sufferer.<\/li><li>Keep pets out of the bedroom of the allergy sufferer.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_kGr9zW": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
